      "instance_name": "man",
      "label": "person",
      "description": "A man with East Asian features, wearing a light blue collared shirt and a red tie, is singing passionately into a microphone. His face is contorted in an expressive, intense manner, with his mouth wide open and eyes squinted, suggesting he is putting great emotional energy into his performance. He is holding the microphone with both hands close to his mouth. The background is dark and out of focus, drawing attention to the man and his performance.",
